   "text": "Swansea University - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nSwansea University - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nSwansea University has 8 colleges spread across its two campuses which are located on the coastline of Swansea Bay, a very beautiful part of Wales. The Hillary Rodham Clinton School of Law is the largest Law School in Wales and ranks third in the UK for Criminology and twenty-second in the UK for Law (The Times Good University Guide 2019). Swansea University Medical School is ranked as the third best medical school in the UK according to the Complete University Guide 2017. It also ranked joint first in the UK for Research Environment, according to the Research Excellence Framework 2014.\nInternational Students can study Undergraduate and Postgraduate pathways with at the International College which lead onto a degree at Swansea University. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:20\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:53\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £18,244.00\nMin: £10,082.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n14%\n1,690 of 12,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1920\nCampus(es)\nSwansea\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BX3X7_gSSkE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
